      en: ["Headquarters of the namesake sub-prefecture in Ouham-Pendé.", "Key center for the production and export of tobacco and cotton.", "Located in a hilly upland region near the border with Cameroon.", "The town serves as a prominent religious hub for the area.", "The headwaters of the Pendé River are located nearby.", "Situated at an average elevation of 1,050 meters above sea level."],
