      en: ["Abba is located in the Nana-Mambéré prefecture in western CAR.", "The town is approximately 450 km northwest of the capital, Bangui.", "Key agricultural products include cassava, maize, and peanuts.", "It sits in a transitional geographic zone between savanna and forest.", "Abba serves as the administrative center for its sub-prefecture.", "The local population is primarily engaged in subsistence farming."],
