      en: ["Ippy is located on a high plateau in the Ouaka prefecture.", "The town is approximately 500 km northeast of Bangui.", "Historically, Ippy was a major center for the diamond trade.", "The region is known for producing coffee and tobacco.", "The town serves as the administrative seat of the Ippy sub-prefecture.", "Ippy features an airstrip for regional air transport."],
